DELAY 5000

REM Open Spotlight Search
GUI SPACE
DELAY 500

REM Search for and launch Terminal
STRING terminal
ENTER

REM Give Terminal time to open (adjust this delay if the Mac is slower)
DELAY 1500

REM Use the macOS 'open' command to launch the URL in the default browser
STRING open https://www.linkedin.com/in/steven-hainley-836262268/
ENTER

REM Optional: Close the Terminal window behind it
DELAY 500
GUI w


